(6875353, 1036029, 108069, '<td valign="top">Composition, processing and tonal range make this an extremely interesting photo. There''s a lot of rhythm and motion throughout as well. Great stuff.</td>', 'Composition, processing and tonal range make this an extremely interesting photo. There''s a lot of rhythm and motion throughout as well. Great stuff.', '2012-10-04 09:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
