(6875443, 1036032, 34059, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well, I like everything about it, colors, fog, composition... an 8 from me!<br/> <br/>PS<br/>Next time remember to give a title to your entry! Looks like it''s the name of the file...</td>', 'I hope this does well, I like everything about it, colors, fog, composition... an 8 from me! PSNext time remember to give a title to your entry! Looks like it''s the name of the file...', '2012-10-04 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
