(6875563, 1035762, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever composition, nice arrangement of clouds. I''m embarrassed to say that while I like the idea very much, I think it needs a bit more pop to stand out. Maybe a bit more tonal range, and possibly the nose cleaned up a bit to make the tones smoother. Well seen though.</td>', 'Clever composition, nice arrangement of clouds. I''m embarrassed to say that while I like the idea very much, I think it needs a bit more pop to stand out. Maybe a bit more tonal range, and possibly the nose cleaned up a bit to make the tones smoother. Well seen though.', '2012-10-04 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
