(6877792, 1035988, 34059, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if look at the tree or the pylon... this distracts from the enjoyment of the photo, maybe focusing on one subject only would have been more effective</td>', 'I am not sure if look at the tree or the pylon... this distracts from the enjoyment of the photo, maybe focusing on one subject only would have been more effective', '2012-10-07 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
