(6878577, 1035957, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice open-ness of the shot.  The colors seem a bit off to me, but I like the centered tree, the intersecting/overlapping lines, etc.</td>', 'Nice open-ness of the shot.  The colors seem a bit off to me, but I like the centered tree, the intersecting/overlapping lines, etc.', '2012-10-08 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878586, 1035901, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite shot in the series.  <br/>Yet, I find that it almost disappears.  I would have liked to see a little more sharpness around the glass edges; and perhaps a little more space at the bottom of the glass. <br/>Other than that, I love the concept.  Great title.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is probably my favorite shot in the series.  Yet, I find that it almost disappears.  I would have liked to see a little more sharpness around the glass edges; and perhaps a little more space at the bottom of the glass. Other than that, I love the concept.  Great title.  Nicely done.', '2012-10-08 13:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878587, 1036084, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the pink on black.  Nice contrast in the colors.<br/>Well shot.  Great exposure.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the pink on black.  Nice contrast in the colors.Well shot.  Great exposure.Nicely done.', '2012-10-08 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878589, 1036065, 134859, '<td valign="top">While I like this shot, it seems like something''s "off".  <br/>The background seems desaturated on the left of the photo but not on the right.  <br/>The lighting is a little harsh, IMO.  Perhaps a softer light or post processing with soft focus would have helped some?<br/>Maybe someone with a better eye/more experience could help out more.</td>', 'While I like this shot, it seems like something''s "off".  The background seems desaturated on the left of the photo but not on the right.  The lighting is a little harsh, IMO.  Perhaps a softer light or post processing with soft focus would have helped some?Maybe someone with a better eye/more experience could help out more.', '2012-10-08 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878590, 1035538, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the cleanness to this shot.  Great contrasting with the black and white.  The floor almost disappears, which is a great touch.  <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Love the cleanness to this shot.  Great contrasting with the black and white.  The floor almost disappears, which is a great touch.  Very well done.', '2012-10-08 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878591, 1035199, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Nice colors against the pure white background.  The frog really pops.  Great detail.  Very well done!</td>', 'Love this shot.  Nice colors against the pure white background.  The frog really pops.  Great detail.  Very well done!', '2012-10-08 13:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878593, 1036037, 134859, '<td valign="top">Don''t like that I had to scroll down to see the picture of the sailboat.<br/>However, I love the use of sky in this shot.  There is an overwhelming amount, which adds a great "negative space" feel.  Along with the vastness of the ocean, and the lone sailboat.<br/>Nicely executed!</td>', 'Don''t like that I had to scroll down to see the picture of the sailboat.However, I love the use of sky in this shot.  There is an overwhelming amount, which adds a great "negative space" feel.  Along with the vastness of the ocean, and the lone sailboat.Nicely executed!', '2012-10-08 13:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878596, 1035907, 134859, '<td valign="top">A shot in my top ten.<br/>Love the darkness and shadows cast on the face.  The subject almost disappears into the background... but you can still see certain definition. <br/>Nicely done.  <br/> <br/>I would have gotten rid of the watch, however... it''s somewhat distracting.</td>', 'A shot in my top ten.Love the darkness and shadows cast on the face.  The subject almost disappears into the background... but you can still see certain definition. Nicely done.   I would have gotten rid of the watch, however... it''s somewhat distracting.', '2012-10-08 13:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878597, 1035914, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fireworks shot.  Love the city lights.<br/>Lovely colors.<br/>Nice use of negative space.<br/>And the moon looks tiny in this shot!  Amazing capture.</td>', 'Beautiful fireworks shot.  Love the city lights.Lovely colors.Nice use of negative space.And the moon looks tiny in this shot!  Amazing capture.', '2012-10-08 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878598, 1036029, 134859, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure I recognize this work.  <br/> <br/>LOVE the reflections of the clouds in the water.  The edge of the boat that is picture is a nice additive.  <br/>Great processing!  In my top 10!</td>', 'Pretty sure I recognize this work.   LOVE the reflections of the clouds in the water.  The edge of the boat that is picture is a nice additive.  Great processing!  In my top 10!', '2012-10-08 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878666, 1035420, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very clean shot.  Nice use of negative space.<br/>Love the simplisticness (is that even a word? lol)<br/> <br/>Anyhow... only complaint is that the lighting seems to be a little bright in some areas of the curl... <br/>But wonderful shot overall.</td>', 'Very clean shot.  Nice use of negative space.Love the simplisticness (is that even a word? lol) Anyhow... only complaint is that the lighting seems to be a little bright in some areas of the curl... But wonderful shot overall.', '2012-10-08 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878668, 1036073, 134859, '<td valign="top">LOVE this shot.  <br/>The bright pink socks add that color pop and tie in well with her bows in hair.<br/> <br/>Smelling the flowers is a nice touch.  <br/> <br/>The only downside is that there is a lot of white going on, on the bricks to the left (where the little girl is standing).  Took away from the photo/negative space feel of the shot, IMO.<br/> <br/>Great shot overall, however.  :)</td>', 'LOVE this shot.  The bright pink socks add that color pop and tie in well with her bows in hair. Smelling the flowers is a nice touch.   The only downside is that there is a lot of white going on, on the bricks to the left (where the little girl is standing).  Took away from the photo/negative space feel of the shot, IMO. Great shot overall, however.  :)', '2012-10-08 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878670, 1036043, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. <br/>Very elegant.  Love the simplistic feel this photo has.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Very elegant.  Love the simplistic feel this photo has.', '2012-10-08 14:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
