(6879795, 1036055, 104230, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to "see" the face!! I guess it''s that field /ground thing!<br/> <br/>Very creative response to the challenge topic. Love this.</td>', 'Took me a while to "see" the face!! I guess it''s that field /ground thing! Very creative response to the challenge topic. Love this.', '2012-10-09 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879798, 1036001, 100831, '<td valign="top">Awesome ... disconcerting maybe but works for the challenge.... love the dark stuf and the lone subject.</td>', 'Awesome ... disconcerting maybe but works for the challenge.... love the dark stuf and the lone subject.', '2012-10-09 23:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879799, 1035860, 100831, '<td valign="top">cool... love the shadow, light, color.. really</td>', 'cool... love the shadow, light, color.. really', '2012-10-09 23:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879800, 1036001, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top three for me - I love the way the lines of the stairs support the figure and the inherent interest or their lines.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Top three for me - I love the way the lines of the stairs support the figure and the inherent interest or their lines.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-09 23:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879803, 1035902, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top three for me.  I just love the suggestion of the curves of this zipper - very cool.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Top three for me.  I just love the suggestion of the curves of this zipper - very cool.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879804, 1036043, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top three - probably my favorite of the challenge.  May not be enough "negative" space for some but I favor a background that supports the subject and is interesting in its own right.  This one does that.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Top three - probably my favorite of the challenge.  May not be enough "negative" space for some but I favor a background that supports the subject and is interesting in its own right.  This one does that.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879805, 1035892, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very clever - light on dark and dark on light, the negative and the positive.  Nicely seen.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Very clever - light on dark and dark on light, the negative and the positive.  Nicely seen.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879807, 1036029, 138630, '<td valign="top">I think it''s so cool the way the nose of this boat fits into the shape of the land - it''s all like pieces of a four piece puzzle.  Enough going on in the background to hold my interest but not so much as to distract from the boat.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I think it''s so cool the way the nose of this boat fits into the shape of the land - it''s all like pieces of a four piece puzzle.  Enough going on in the background to hold my interest but not so much as to distract from the boat.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879808, 1035588, 50695, '<td valign="top">now if his sister were facing him and they formed a vase together, I would be totally on board with this. (just kidding, this is a valid meditation on negative space, but I''m recusing myself)</td>', 'now if his sister were facing him and they formed a vase together, I would be totally on board with this. (just kidding, this is a valid meditation on negative space, but I''m recusing myself)', '2012-10-10 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879809, 1036002, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific use of the "negative" space to complete the story here.  I really like the composition.  Bet this looks good in black and white, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Terrific use of the "negative" space to complete the story here.  I really like the composition.  Bet this looks good in black and white, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
