(6879821, 1035900, 138630, '<td valign="top">I smile each time I look at this - what a pose and expression.  Biting his nails or so it seems.  All that blue suggests he is very high and "out there" indeed and, though empty, definitely contributes to the story here.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I smile each time I look at this - what a pose and expression.  Biting his nails or so it seems.  All that blue suggests he is very high and "out there" indeed and, though empty, definitely contributes to the story here.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-10 00:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
