(6879972, 1035989, 49511, '<td valign="top">The idea was to have the sign for what it is and at the same time to show that it consists of two crosses; a black one and<br/>a shiny lighter one. That may have worked out pretty good but then i ruined the shot with terrible processing; at least since the save for web stage, it looks somewhat better here ;p<br/> <br/>Anyway, thx for voting and the responses<br/> <br/>ps. as you can see iso was 80, i ruined it all by myself ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'The idea was to have the sign for what it is and at the same time to show that it consists of two crosses; a black one anda shiny lighter one. That may have worked out pretty good but then i ruined the shot with terrible processing; at least since the save for web stage, it looks somewhat better here ;p Anyway, thx for voting and the responses ps. as you can see iso was 80, i ruined it all by myself ;) ', '2012-10-10 02:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
