(6885493, 1035954, 96509, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and votes, <br/>I didn''t saw the dog in turning it side ways but now I see it clearly. <br/>In my mind it was a women walking with a long skirt. The dog I originally saw is in the bottom of the skirt jumping towards the women, sort of like a small terrier, you can see the small ears lagging back behind the head.<br/>The one that appear turning image is much more clear, like a dachshund I think.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and votes, I didn''t saw the dog in turning it side ways but now I see it clearly. In my mind it was a women walking with a long skirt. The dog I originally saw is in the bottom of the skirt jumping towards the women, sort of like a small terrier, you can see the small ears lagging back behind the head.The one that appear turning image is much more clear, like a dachshund I think.', '2012-10-18 12:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
